@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### Health: database, redis, storage đều up
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

?? status == 200
?? body details.database.status == up
?? body details.redis.status == up
?? body details.storage.status == up

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

?? status == 200
?? body status == ok

### Swagger JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs-json

?? status == 200
?? body info.title == Luna Knowledge API

### Route không tồn tại → 404 format lỗi chuẩn
GET {{apiUrl}}/does-not-exist

?? status == 404
?? body error.code == NOT_FOUND
?? body error.requestId exists

### Giữ x-request-id của client
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
X-Request-Id: trace-from-http-file

?? status == 200
?? header x-request-id == trace-from-http-file

### Không có token → 401
GET {{apiUrl}}/me

?? status == 401
?? body error.code == UNAUTHENTICATED
